UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<h4>Overview</h4> <p> Prepare yourself for a career as a business leader in the contemporary information society and economy. </p><p>This dual program equips you with the self-confidence, advanced communication and business management skills to effectively manage a wide range of competitive environments.</p><p>During courses developed in close collaboration with UQ industry partners, you''ll study topics including accounting, economics, law, marketing, business information systems and strategy.</p><p>Your grounding in business fundamentals will be complemented by studies in communication. You''ll develop skills in visual, written, multimedia, spoken and interpersonal communication through researching and exploring communications.</p><p>This combination will give you a unique skillset in preparation for a wide range of exciting career opportunities in the public, private and not-for-profit sectors. Many of our alumni work in leadership positions across a diverse range of industries.</p><p><a href="#tab1">Domestic</a><a href="#tab2">International</a></p><p><a href="#entry-requirements">See full entry requirements</a></p>LocationSt LuciaDuration 4 Years (or part time equivalent)Start SemesterSemester 1 (22 Feb, 2027), Semester 2 (26 Jul, 2027)QTAC Code<p>711511</p>Program Code2509AQFLevel 7<p><a href="#how-to-apply">Admission schemes available</a></p><p><a href="#fees-scholarships">Scholarships available</a></p><p><a href="#entry-requirements">See full entry requirements</a></p>LocationSt LuciaFees<a href="#fees-scholarships">A$56800</a>Duration 4 Years Start Semester Semester 1 (22 Feb, 2027), Semester 2 (26 Jul, 2027) Semester dates for 2028 are yet to be confirmed QTAC Code<p>711511</p>Program Code2509CRICOS Code089657AAQFLevel 7<p><a href="#fees-scholarships">Scholarships available</a></p> <p> <h5> Program highlights </h5> </p> <p> <h5> Program highlights </h5> </p> <ul><li>Examine real-life case studies and gain practical experience through projects, placements and internships with leading businesses. </li><li>Join one of the world''s top business schools and learn from award-winning research teachers and industry guest lecturers.</li><li>Customise your studies by completing one of 7 diverse business management majors and either Digital Media or Strategic Communication.</li></ul> <p>1 in Queensland for business and management studies</p><p>QS World University Rankings 2026</p> <p>1 in Queensland for arts and humanities</p><p>QS World University Rankings 2026</p> <p> <h5> Majors </h5> </p> <p>Tailor your studies to suit your goals. This program offers these options:</p><ul><li><p>Business Economics</p></li><li><p>Business Information Systems</p></li><li><p>Digital Media</p></li><li><p>Human Resources</p></li></ul><p><a href="#majors">See all majors</a></p> <p> <h5> How you''ll learn </h5> </p> <p>Your learning experiences are designed to best suit the learning outcomes of the courses you choose.</p><ul><li>Lectures</li><li>Tutorials</li><li>Work placements</li><li>Seminars</li><li>Studios</li><li>Workshops</li></ul> <p> <h5> What you''ll study </h5> </p> <p>At UQ, degrees are called ''programs'' and subjects are called ''courses''.</p><p><a href="https://programs-courses.uq.edu.au/requirements/program/2509/2027">See courses and program structure</a></p><p><a href="https://www.uq.edu.au/study/docs/dual-degree-planners-2027/2027-Bachelors-of-Business-Management-Communication-2509.pdf">View dual degree planner (PDF)</a></p> <p> <h5> Career possibilities </h5> </p> <p>Our programs prepare you for your first job and beyond. Depending on which major you choose, here are some of the careers you could be on your way to:</p><ul><li>Communications manager</li><li>Public relations account manager</li><li>Social media strategist</li><li>Marketing officer</li><li>Business development specialist</li><li>Human resources officer</li><li>Copywriter</li><li>Advertising specialist</li><li>International business executive</li><li>Business analyst</li></ul> <p>Average annual salary range</p><h5>Marketing Manager</h5>$110–$130K<p>seek.com.au</p><p>Average annual salary range</p><h5>Communications Adviser</h5>$105–$115K<p>seek.com.au</p> <p> <h5> Professional memberships </h5> </p> <p>When you graduate, you may be eligible for memberships with the following professional organisations. Contact the organisation to find out how to become a member.</p><ul><li>Australian Human Resources Institute</li><li>Australian Marketing Institute</li><li>Economic Society of Australia</li></ul> <p>With the support of UQ’s experienced teaching team, my program equipped me with the foundational skills to make an impact on the industry at a very young age.</p><p> Kacy Miaco </p><p> Graduate, Bachelors of Business Management / Communication </p><p>The experience working with real companies during internships at UQ has given me an edge and prepared me for the real work environment after graduation.</p><p> Anantha (Nandu) Padmanabhan Anu </p><p> Bachelor of Business Management </p><p>There were a lot of opportunities for practical knowledge and growth and I needed that. Working where I am now, I can see how the courses were relevant and I use my knowledge every day. </p><p> Rosy Lone </p><p> Graduate, Bachelor of Communication </p> <p><a href="/events">See all events</a></p> <a href="/events/ancient-history-experience-day"> Ancient History Experience Day </a><p>15 July </p><h5> Ancient History Experience Day </h5><p>St Lucia</p><a href="/events/world-religions-experience-day-2026"> World Religions Experience Day 2026 </a><p>22 July - 23 July </p><h5> World Religions Experience Day 2026 </h5><p>St Lucia</p><a href="/events/uq-open-day"> UQ Open Day </a><p>2 August </p><h5> UQ Open Day </h5><p>St Lucia</p> <p><a href="/stories">See all stories</a></p> <a href="/stories/business-management-majors-diversify-your-career-opportunities"> Business management majors: diversify your career opportunities </a><p>Careers</p><h5> Business management majors: diversify your career opportunities </h5><p>4-minute read</p><a href="/stories/why-study-business-uq"> Why study business at UQ? </a><p>Study tips</p><h5> Why study business at UQ? </h5><p>7-minute read</p><a href="/stories/why-study-marketing-uq"> Why study marketing at UQ? </a><p>Study tips</p><h5> Why study marketing at UQ? </h5><p>6-minute read</p>',
