UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<h4>Overview</h4> <p> Become a global communicator and influence what the world reads, watches and understands. </p><p>Journalism and digital media have never been so exciting, with new frontiers in researching and publishing leading to all kinds of opportunities.</p><p>This dual degree will give you the business skills and self-confidence to succeed. You''ll learn how to confidently lead people and projects, and how to work as a creative journalist.</p><p>In your business degree you''ll study topics like accounting, economics, marketing and strategy, while building an understanding of the fundamentals of journalism and media.</p><p>Combining business and journalism skills will prepare you for a career in writing, digital media, publishing, communications, public relations and more.</p><p><a href="#tab1">Domestic</a><a href="#tab2">International</a></p><p><a href="#entry-requirements">See full entry requirements</a></p>LocationSt LuciaDuration 4 Years (or part time equivalent)Start SemesterSemester 1 (22 Feb, 2027), Semester 2 (26 Jul, 2027)QTAC Code<p>711101</p>Program Code2510AQFLevel 7<p><a href="#how-to-apply">Admission schemes available</a></p><p><a href="#fees-scholarships">Scholarships available</a></p><p><a href="#entry-requirements">See full entry requirements</a></p>LocationSt LuciaFees<a href="#fees-scholarships">A$56800</a>Duration 4 Years Start Semester Semester 1 (22 Feb, 2027), Semester 2 (26 Jul, 2027) Semester dates for 2028 are yet to be confirmed QTAC Code<p>711101</p>Program Code2510CRICOS Code098332CAQFLevel 7<p><a href="#fees-scholarships">Scholarships available</a></p> <p> <h5> Program highlights </h5> </p> <p> <h5> Program highlights </h5> </p> <ul><li>Benefit from applied projects, real-life case studies and guest lectures by industry experts.</li><li>Take advantage of opportunities to gain practical experience through placements and internships with leading businesses.</li><li>Develop in-demand skills in field recording and camerawork, editing, publishing and distribution.</li><li>Tailor your studies to align with your interests and career goals. Choose one major from 7 different business specialisations. </li></ul> <p>1 in Queensland for business and management studies</p><p>QS World University Rankings 2026</p> <p>1 in Queensland for arts and humanities</p><p>QS World University Rankings 2026</p> <p> <h5> Majors </h5> </p> <p>Tailor your studies to suit your goals. This program offers these options:</p><ul><li><p>Business Economics</p></li><li><p>Business Information Systems</p></li><li><p>Human Resources</p></li><li><p>Innovation and Entrepreneurship</p></li></ul><p><a href="#majors">See all majors</a></p> <p> <h5> How you''ll learn </h5> </p> <p>Your learning experiences are designed to best suit the learning outcomes of the courses you choose.</p><ul><li>Lectures</li><li>Tutorials</li><li>Fieldwork</li><li>Seminars</li><li>Studios</li><li>Workshops</li></ul> <p> <h5> What you''ll study </h5> </p> <p>At UQ, degrees are called ''programs'' and subjects are called ''courses''.</p><p><a href="https://programs-courses.uq.edu.au/requirements/program/2510/2027">See courses and program structure</a></p><p><a href="https://www.uq.edu.au/study/docs/dual-degree-planners-2027/2027-Bachelors-of-Business-Management-Journalism-2510.pdf">View dual degree planner (PDF)</a></p> <p> <h5> Career possibilities </h5> </p> <p>Our programs prepare you for your first job and beyond. Depending on which major you choose, here are some of the careers you could be on your way to:</p><ul><li>Copywriter</li><li>Account manager</li><li>Public relations officer</li><li>Corporate communications officer</li><li>Social media manager</li><li>Marketing manager</li><li>Business development specialist</li><li>Marketing manager</li><li>Sales manager</li><li>Managing director</li></ul> <p>Average annual salary range</p><h5>Marketing Manager</h5>$110–$130K<p>seek.com.au</p><p>Average annual salary range</p><h5>Communications Adviser</h5>$105–$115K<p>seek.com.au</p> <p> <h5> Professional memberships </h5> </p> <p>When you graduate, you may be eligible for memberships with the following professional organisations. Contact the organisation to find out how to become a member.</p><ul><li>Australian Human Resources Institute</li><li>Australian Marketing Institute</li><li>Economic Society of Australia</li></ul> <p>I consider the mixed degree of Business Management and Journalism at UQ imperative to acquiring my role as Associate Account Strategist at Google. With a diverse course load I gained an understanding of different perspectives that was critical in employability. </p><p> Jordan McMullen </p><p> Graduate, Bachelor of Business Management/Bachelor of Journalism </p><p>During my studies, I had the chance to intern at a bio-chemical engineering firm in Singapore, where I gained first-hand insight into the startup ecosystem. This experience ultimately led me to compete in a pitch competition at Oxford University on wicked problems.</p><p> Cory Su </p><p> Graduate, Bachelors of Business Management / Design </p> <p><a href="/events">See all events</a></p> <a href="/events/ancient-history-experience-day"> Ancient History Experience Day </a><p>15 July </p><h5> Ancient History Experience Day </h5><p>St Lucia</p><a href="/events/world-religions-experience-day-2026"> World Religions Experience Day 2026 </a><p>22 July - 23 July </p><h5> World Religions Experience Day 2026 </h5><p>St Lucia</p><a href="/events/uq-open-day"> UQ Open Day </a><p>2 August </p><h5> UQ Open Day </h5><p>St Lucia</p> <p><a href="/stories">See all stories</a></p> <a href="/stories/business-management-majors-diversify-your-career-opportunities"> Business management majors: diversify your career opportunities </a><p>Careers</p><h5> Business management majors: diversify your career opportunities </h5><p>4-minute read</p><a href="/stories/how-i-launched-social-media-agency-while-studying-uq"> How I launched a social media agency while studying at UQ </a><p>Careers</p><h5> How I launched a social media agency while studying at UQ </h5><p>5-minute read</p><a href="/stories/is-a-journalism-degree-worth-it"> Is a journalism degree worth it? </a><p>Study tips</p><h5> Is a journalism degree worth it? </h5><p>10-minute read</p>',
