? </h5> </p> <p>We can help you meet the minimum entry score, subject prerequisites or English language requirements for your preferred program.</p><p><a href="/admissions/undergraduate/consider-your-pathway-options">Learn about pathway options</a></p> <p> <h5> Additional application information </h5> </p> <p> Specialist Mathematics (Units 3 &amp; 4, C) is recommended. Students without Specialist Mathematics (or equivalent) may be required to undertake preparatory courses beyond the 64 units for the program and may not be able to complete the program in the minimum time frame without overloading or undertaking summer study. </p>',
