erience Day 2026 </a><p>22 July - 23 July </p><h5> World Religions Experience Day 2026 </h5><p>St Lucia</p><a href="/events/uq-open-day"> UQ Open Day </a><p>2 August </p><h5> UQ Open Day </h5><p>St Lucia</p> <p><a href="/stories">See all stories</a></p> <a href="/stories/meet-jojo-environmental-management-student-china"> Meet JoJo, an Environmental Management student from China </a><p>UQ people</p><h5> Meet JoJo, an Environmental Management student from China </h5><p>5-minute</p><a href="/stories/study-environmental-conservation-postgrad-uq"> Study environmental conservation as a postgrad at UQ </a><p>Study tips</p><h5> Study environmental conservation as a postgrad at UQ </h5><p>5-minute read</p><a href="/stories/why-study-environmental-science"> Why study environmental science? </a><p>Careers</p><h5> Why study environmental science? </h5><p>6-minute read</p>',
